      "writtenOn": "2018-05-22T00:11:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the port doesn\u0027t have a pending lpm_entry, then canceling the request is what needs to happen. Otherwise, the extra request will cause the TCPC to exit low power mode.",
